OL,3,GNEWSALock closures and low water levels
OL,4,Amaroons boaters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired boat-dwelling couple fear
OL,7,Fthey could be marooned for months
OL,8,Fbecause of efforts to fight a major
OL,9,Fwildfire and conserve water levels.
OL,11,FTerry and Margaret Watson, from
OL,12,FNorthampton, said that emergency lock
OL,13,Fclosures to allow firefighters to
OL,14,Fabstract water from the River Nene has
OL,15,Fleft them marooned at Foxes Marina,
OL,16,FMarch - 80 miles (129k) away from their
OL,17,Fusual home mooring,
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a couple mooring in the Ely
OL,20,Farea said they were currently stuck in
OL,21,FNorthampton.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
