OL,3,GNEWSALock closures and low water levels
OL,4,Amaroons boaters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Middle Level Commissioners (MLC),
OL,7,Fwho look after the waterways in
OL,8,FFenland, said its system was acting as
OL,9,Fa 'conduit' to transfer water to the
OL,10,FHolme Fen fire area and working closely
OL,11,Fto support the various agencies
OL,12,Finvolved.
